{
  "id": "syn-n2-en-lists",
  "schemaVersion": "1.1.0",
  "source": "synthetic",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "The Workshop Shelf"
        }
      ],
      "origin": {
        "pageFrom": 1,
        "pageTo": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Every tool in the shelf has a place,\nand every place has a rule that keeps\nthe shelf usable after a long week\nof sawdust, oil and sudden repairs."
        }
      ],
      "origin": {
        "pageFrom": 1,
        "pageTo": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "* Keep the morning tools dry\neven after a rush of work."
        }
      ],
      "origin": {
        "pageFrom": 1,
        "pageTo": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "* Oil the hinge of the blue door\nevery month without exception."
        }
      ],
      "origin": {
        "pageFrom": 1,
        "pageTo": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "1. Sweep the boards at noon,\nbefore the dust settles again."
        }
      ],
      "origin": {
        "pageFrom": 1,
        "pageTo": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "list_item",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "2. Close the window before rain\nand latch it from the inside."
        }
      ],
      "origin": {
        "pageFrom": 1,
        "pageTo": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A shelf that follows these lines\nneeds no inventory: the eye reads\nthe order before the mind does,\nand the hand finds the tool alone."
        }
      ],
      "origin": {
        "pageFrom": 1,
        "pageTo": 1
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Plates and Tables"
        }
      ],
      "origin": {
        "pageFrom": 2,
        "pageTo": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "The lamp above the old door has\ntwo hours of light on summer nights\nand almost none in the wet months,\nwhen the wind keeps everyone in."
        }
      ],
      "origin": {
        "pageFrom": 2,
        "pageTo": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Fig. 1 - The lamp above the old door."
        }
      ],
      "origin": {
        "pageFrom": 2,
        "pageTo": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "The table below counts those hours\nthe way the grandmother counted them:\non fingers first, then on the wall\nof the pantry, in pencil."
        }
      ],
      "origin": {
        "pageFrom": 2,
        "pageTo": 2
      }
    },
    {
      "kind": "caption",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Table 2 - Hours of light, by month."
        }
      ],
      "origin": {
        "pageFrom": 2,
        "pageTo": 2
      }
    }
  ]
}
